      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Translator**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API as the external translation service for the `translate_text.py` script. The next step is to make sure it's clearly defined and identifiable within the Python code. I'm focusing on how best to integrate this API.\n\n\n**Establishing the Structure**\n\nNow I have a clearer picture. The `translate_text.py` file is created, and the framework for using the Google Cloud Translation API is in place. The code will include imports and a function for translation. I will focus on defining the `translate.Client()` as the key identifier for the Google Cloud API.\n\n\n",
